====================

The Rust crates the ptmprophet-rs release builds are made from (a few listed
crates are not linked into either), grouped by license, including the C code
and data those crates compile in. The Rust standard library is listed in
licenses/Rust-standard-library.html. PTMProphet-rs's own license is in
COPYING.LESSER and COPYING, and NOTICE lists the TPP files it derives from.
